transcript:
Important wheat innovation for men Now
• Improved wheat seeds for men
• Wheat – Bijoy – at present, most farmers are using bijoy and shotabdi seed. And a few farmers got 26 and 28 seeds.
• CIMMYT local partner SDS introduced several technologies to the local farmers. These are including:
• seeder (PTOS) machine, reaper machine and power thresher machine and weed killer chemical etc.
• Some farmers are practicing several types of wheat cultivation e.g. strip tillage and local methods. These separate methods give practical knowledge and comparative outputs.
• Improved fertilizers and pesticides
• Currently, trainings, knowledge sharing, information disseminations through field school and other forums are helping the farmers;
• New knowledge, information, and relevant knowledge consultation;
• Raising chicken and livestock;
